# Genji Glove {5}, Equip {3}: "Equipped creature has double strike. Whenever equipped creature attacks, if it's the first combat phase of the turn, untap it. After this phase,
# there is an additional combat phase" (CR 702.4, 500.8, 603.4). Five Moxen pay for the Glove on turn 1; on turn 3 they pay the equip exactly (the two left over cannot pay a
# second equip). The equipped Memnite hits for 2 in the first combat phase, is untapped, and attacks again in the additional phase, which is not the first, so there is no third
# phase: 2 more, 16 in all. The Ornithopter holding no Glove has no double strike and no trigger.

